     <p class=\"p-top-mv__scroll-point\"></p>\r\n                </a>\r\n                <div id=\"scrollnow\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!--首頁內容區塊-->\r\n        <div class=\"mainContent\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"indexwrap\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                <!-- index01 -->\r\n                <div class=\"index01wrap\">\r\n                    <div class=\"text aos-init aos-animate\" aos=\"fade-right\">\r\n                        <div class=\"top\">\r\n                            <div class=\"index_titleblock\">ABOUT US</div>\r\n\r\n                            <h3>Samwell International Inc.</h3>\r\n                            <p>Become a global one-stop service platform</p>\r\n                            <h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #808080;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Established in 1975, Samwell Group has been the world's leading manufacturer in providing&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: #808080;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">CMSR &amp; LSR,&nbsp;electronic manufacturing services (EMS), customized tooling design, and&nbsp;ultrasonic welding assembly.&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #808080;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">With our extensive expertise in R&amp;D, manufacturing and supply chain management, we take pride in transforming design concepts into reality. With our comprehensive system integration capabilities, Samwell can quickly respond to customer needs and provide customers with a full range of customzed product assembly successfully. Our collaborative approach aims not only to reduce your product costs but also to ensure the highest standards of manufacturing quality.</span></span></span></span></p></h4>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"mumping_mun mumping_mun01\">\r\n                            <li>\r\n                                <div class=\"mun_top\">\r\n                                    <img src=\"web/images/index_icon01.png\">\r\n                                    <h2 class=\"timer timer01 count-title\" id=\"count-number01\" data-to=\"50\"\r\n                                        data-speed=\"1500\">50+</h2>\r\n                                    <p>years of manufacturing experience</p>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </li>\r\n                            <li>\r\n                                <div class=\"mun_top\">\r\n                                    <img src=\"web/images/index_icon02.png\">\r\n                                    <h2 class=\"timer timer01 count-title\" id=\"count-number\" data-to=\"2000\"\r\n                                        data-speed=\"1500\">2000</h2>\r\n                                    <p>successful turnkey projects</p>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </li>\r\n                            <li>\r\n                                <div class=\"mun_top\">\r\n                                    <img src=\"web/images/index_icon03.png\">\r\n                                    <h2 class=\"timer timer01 count-title\" id=\"count-number03\" data-to=\"5000\"\r\n                                        data-speed=\"1500\">5000+</h2>\r\n                                    <p>professional technical solutions</p>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </li>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- 20230627 Patty 修改 start -->\r\n                            <script>\r\n                                 window.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function() {\r\n                                    var element03 = document.getElementById(\"count-number03\");\r\n                                    var value03 = element03.getAttribute(\"data-to\");\r\n                                    element03.innerText = value03 + \"+\";\r\n                                    \r\n                                    var element01 = document.getElementById(\"count-number01\");\r\n                                    var value01 = element01.getAttribute(\"data-to\");\r\n                                    element01.innerText = value01 + \"+\";\r\n                                });\r\n                            </script>\r\n                            <!-- 20230627 Patty 修改 end -->\r\n                        </ul>\r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"imgbox aos-init aos-animate\" aos=\"fade-left\">\r\n                        <img src=\"/uploads/index_about/en/1-1. Home_About us.jpg\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                <!-- index02 -->\r\n                <div class=\"index02wrap\">\r\n                    <div class=\"i-tl aos-init\" aos=\"fade-up\">\r\n                        <!-- <div class=\"index_titleblock\">ABILITY</div> -->\r\n                        <!-- <font>ABILITY</font> -->\r\n                        <h3>Core Capabilities</h3>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"swiper-container swiper-container01 swiper-container-horizontal aos-init\" aos=\"fade-up\">\r\n                        <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-active\" style=\"width: 475.75px;\">\r\n                                <a href=\"web/capabilities/capabilities.jsp?dm_id=DM1678754868035\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"sil-tile__square\"></div>\r\n                                    <img src=\"/uploads/capabilities_category/en/DSC_0141-1.jpg\" class=\"bg\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"title_font\">01</div>\r\n                                    <!-- <font>01</font> -->\r\n                                    <div class=\"textshow\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"img01\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"web/images/index_icon11.png\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"web/images/index_icon21.png\">\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"font01\">\r\n                                            <h3>CMSR</h3>\r\n                                            <strong></strong>\r\n                                            <h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">With 50-year experience, Samwell specializes in high-volume compression molding silicone rubber (CMSR) and excels in creating a wide range of parts, including keypads, keyboards, Gaskets/O-rings, and intricate medical parts. Our silicone compression molding process offers numerous benefits, including high production rate, top quality and short lead time, and cost-effective products.</span></p></h4>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-next\" style=\"width: 475.75px;\">\r\n                                <a href=\"web/capabilities/capabilities.jsp?dm_id=DM1677663204938\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"sil-tile__square\"></div>\r\n                                    <img src=\"/uploads/capabilities_category/en/79806131_l_normal_none-R.jpg\" class=\"bg\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"title_font\">02</div>\r\n                                    <!-- <font>01</font> -->\r\n                                    <div class=\"textshow\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"img01\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"web/images/index_icon11.png\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"web/images/index_icon21.png\">\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"font01\">\r\n                                            <h3>LSR</h3>\r\n                                            <strong></strong>\r\n                                            <h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Liquid silicone rubber (LSR) molding is the use of liquid silicone rubber injection molding machine to produce liquid silicone rubber which is seeing rapid growth, particularly into high-tech fields of applications.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">With Samwell, you can expect to be supported by LSR experts all the way through the design, planning, and manufacturing of your items. We have experience of successfully producing a wide variety of LSR products, including very extra-soft parts, complex products, medical components, and many applications.</span></span></p></h4>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"swiper-slide \" style=\"width: 475.75px;\">\r\n                                <a href=\"web/capabilities/capabilities.jsp?dm_id=DM1677663155952\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"sil-tile__square\"></div>\r\n                                    <img src=\"/uploads/capabilities_category/en/180820761_l_normal_none.jpg\" class=\"bg\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"title_font\">03</div>\r\n                                    <!-- <font>01</font> -->\r\n                                    <div class=\"textshow\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"img01\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"web/images/index_icon11.png\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"web/images/index_icon21.png\">\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"font01\">\r\n                                            <h3>Mechanical & Electrical Design</h3>\r\n                                            <strong></strong>\r\n                                            <h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Arial','sans-serif';\">Samwell has been serving the engineering industry for nearly two decades, catering to a wide range of project requirements for esteemed companies both domestically and internationally. As a market leader in our areas of expertise, we offer comprehensive design, compliance, and management services to our valued customers. We prioritize accuracy, reliability, and efficiency, ensuring that our clients receive the highest level of satisfaction.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Arial','sans-serif';\">Furthermore, our design team provides a wide range of services in mechanical structure design, tooling/mould development, computer-aided analysis and product structure / electrical validation, special expertise in the design for the ruggedized product for which features as extreme temperatures, water, dirt and shock resistance. From prototype to delivery, Samwell can be your best choice.</span></p></h4>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"swiper-slide \" style=\"width: 475.75px;\">\r\n                                <a href=\"web/capabilities/capabilities.jsp?dm_id=DM1677663171670\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"sil-tile__square\"></div>\r\n                                    <img src=\"/uploads/capabilities_category/en/133618629_l_normal_none.jpg\" class=\"bg\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"title_font\">04</div>\r\n                                    <!-- <font>01</font> -->\r\n                                    <div class=\"textshow\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"img01\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"web/images/index_icon11.png\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"web/images/index_icon21.png\">\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"font01\">\r\n                                            <h3>Customized Tooling Design and  Manufacture</h3>\r\n                                            <strong></strong>\r\n                                            <h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Arial','sans-serif';\">At Samwell's, we offer comprehensive design and manufacturing solutions, specializing in customized tooling for a wide range of industries. From initial design concepts to final production and delivery, we provide mechanical design, electrical engineering, hardware and software integration, manufacturing and assembly, and latest technology implementation. Also, we have practical experience in medical molding and assembly with expertise in PFMEA, SPC, lean manufacturing, six sigma, APQP, and PPAP. We are committed to delivering high-quality products and services with a focus on timeliness and competitive pricing.</span></p></h4>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <!-- Add Arrows -->\r\n                        <div class=\"swiper-button-next swiper-button-next01 fa fa-angle-right\" tabindex=\"0\"\r\n                            